message: "If you use this software or the curated datasets in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Seven Governors / the-instrument"
abstract: >-
  Integrated computational research environment for structured state
  representation, music-theoretic organization, and deterministic
  graph-based reasoning. Includes the court-mathematics library, a
  462-state canonical heptatonic ledger, mutation-algebra audit,
  governor runtime, Neo4j projection, and executable verification suite.
